.TH "HYPR-CHEATSHEET" "1" "November 2026" "arran4/dotfiles" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
hypr\-cheatsheet \- show the current Hyprland bindings in a menu
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBhypr\-cheatsheet\fR
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read the active bindings from hyprctl binds \-j and display a sorted summary using a detected rofi, wofi or dmenu interface. This is a read\-only runtime view; selecting an entry does not execute the binding.
.SH NOTES
Unlike the static hyprland\-keys(7) reference, the runtime view reflects only shortcuts registered by the currently running Hyprland instance.
.SH REQUIREMENTS
Needs a running Hyprland session and hyprctl, Python 3, sort,
and a menu program (rofi, wofi or dmenu). The chezmoi template
chooses a menu at generation time. The fallback path expects wofi.
.SH OPERATION
The command requests JSON using hyprctl binds -j. Python converts
modifier bitmasks to readable combinations and prints dispatcher
and argument values. Sorted rows feed the chosen dmenu interface.
The selected row is discarded: this is a reference viewer,
not a command launcher.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
hyprctl binds -j
hypr-cheatsheet
man hyprland-keys
.fi
.SH TROUBLESHOOTING
If no menu appears, check that the generated menu executable is
installed and can start within the same Wayland session. If
bindings are missing, inspect hyprctl binds -j before changing
the static manual: the active compositor configuration wins.
.SH REQUIREMENTS
Requires a running Hyprland session, hyprctl, Python 3, sort, and
a menu utility (rofi, wofi or dmenu). The chezmoi template resolves
a menu at configuration-rendering time.
.SH OPERATION
The command reads hyprctl binds -j, translates modifier masks,
sorts the shortcuts, and shows dispatcher and argument values in
the menu. The selected row is discarded; this does not execute
the corresponding action.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
hyprctl binds -j
hypr-cheatsheet
man hyprland-keys
.fi
.SH TROUBLESHOOTING
If no menu appears, inspect the configured menu executable and
Wayland session. If a binding is missing, compare the active
hyprctl binds output with the static hyprland-keys manual.
.SH SEE ALSO
hyprland\-keys(7), hyprctl(1)
